- [Chuckles]

699
00:49:38.794 --> 00:49:42.591
You-- You were having fun.

700
00:49:44.678 --> 00:49:48.600
Sometimes when you
open up to people,

701
00:49:50.562 --> 00:49:54.109
you let the bad in
with the good, that's all.

702
00:50:02.246 --> 00:50:04.666
