751
00:53:39.280 --> 00:53:41.700
Or maybe now you're thinking,
you know, now that Taylor's free--

752
00:53:41.783 --> 00:53:44.245
Whatever, Dean.

753
00:53:44.329 --> 00:53:47.375
I don't know. Maybe it's
