Laney, I know I made a mistake,

1026
01:12:01.943 --> 01:12:04.446
but I've been doing' some thinking,
and if I could just get, like--

1027
01:12:04.488 --> 01:12:07.534
Stop calling, asshole.

1028
01:12:07.618 --> 01:12:11.916
- ♪ lf I can move it with you
will you let me take you ♪
- Wrong number.

1029
01:12:12.041 --> 01:12:16.256
♪ I'll be down on my knees
screaming, take me ♪

1030
01:12:16.381 --> 01:12:20.345
♪ Take me, take me, take me ♪

1031
01:12:20.429 --> 01:12:23.183
♪ I'm yours ♪

1032
01:12:23.225 --> 01:12:30.235
♪ I never felt so good ♪♪

1033
01:12:30.360 --> 01:12:34.992
Fridge is kind of empty. I'm going to go
to the store later if you need anything.

1034
01:12:35.117 --> 01:12:36.954
Sounds good.

1035
01:12:40.417 --> 01:12:42.754
[Sighs]

1036
01:12:42.879 --> 01:12:45.425
Did you know that some people
think being a pool man...

1037
01:12:45.466 --> 01:12:48.346
is not a very respectable way
to earn a living?

1038
01:12:48.429 --> 01:12:51.934
- People suck, Dad.
- I don't get it, personally.

1039
01:12:51.976 --> 01:12:54.688
I own my own company and my own home,

1040
01:12:54.772 --> 01:12:57.192
put the food on the table.

1041
01:12:57.359 --> 01:12:59.696
Granted, you and Simon help out.

1042
01:13:00.948 --> 01:13:03.577
We're a team.

1043
01:13:03.660 --> 01:13:08.835
Right. Maybe this team thing
is helping to create confusion...

1044
01:13:08.918 --> 01:13:11.923
