here tonight and you'd say yes.

1069
01:15:12.103 --> 01:15:14.690
I mean, that's got to count
for something. Right?

1070
01:15:20.782 --> 01:15:22.744
You don't even have to change
if you don't want to.

1071
01:15:22.785 --> 01:15:25.081
[Both Laugh]

1072
01:15:28.127 --> 01:15:31.173
- Are you ready, Miss Siler?
- Yes, I am, Mr. Siler.

1073
